      "id": "Q1",
      "question": "How does the header know it has an action, without sibling selectors across shadow roots?",
      "recommendation": "sb-card-header listens to slotchange and sets data-has-action on itself; CSS keys off that attribute.",
      "status": "answered",
      "answer": "Host attribute from slotchange (data-has-action).",
      "answeredOn": "2026-11-08"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q2",
      "question": "Optional header and footer borders?",
      "recommendation": "Not in v1: no class hooks in Web Components; add boolean props when a use case appears.",
